      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TOMAHAWK BART (5) has been competitive of late and kept the ball rolling last time when fourth in stronger company at Menangle. Came from the back row for second here prior. He is in the right race to find the winners' list. BEV THE GOAT NZ (2) settled handy and dug deep to score by 1.3m in a higher-graded race last week, taking her strike rate at this distance to 50 per cent. Has won the last three times he has raced here. Could do it again. FIRE FOX NZ (7) draws for a trail and looks close to a win after respectable seconds at his last two appearances, the latest behind Bev The Goat. ALWAYSBGOOD (4) is fitter for recent racing and is suited dropping from city grade having won the only time he raced here.",
